| **fleet-operations.ts** | Fleet management: checking fleet membership, fetching details, listing members, inspecting wing/squad structure |
| **incursions.ts** | Active Sansha incursions and faction warfare statistics (systems and standings) |
| **industry.ts** | Public industry data: facility locations, system cost indices, insurance prices for ships |
| **killmails.ts** | Two-step killmail lookup: fetching recent summaries (auth), then full details (public) |
| **location-tracker.ts** | Real-time location tracking: current system, online status, current ship with name resolution |
| **mail-inbox.ts** | Mail operations: reading inbox headers, labels, mailing lists, individual messages |
| **market-prices.ts** | Market data: global average prices and price history with Tritanium example |
| **rate-limiting.ts** | Rate-limiting awareness, pagination with large datasets, error handling for non-existent resources |
| **route-planner.ts** | Route calculation: shortest path between systems with system name resolution along the route |
| **skills-overview.ts** | Character skill inspection: trained skills, skill queue, and neural remap attributes |
| **sovereignty.ts** | Sovereignty overview: null-sec ownership, ADM indices, active campaigns, top alliances by system count |
